  "summary_en": "Second edition of Germany's AI standardization roadmap by DIN/DKE, commissioned by the Economy Ministry. Drawing on 570+ experts, it identifies 116+ standardization needs across nine themes, including industrial automation, mobility and medicine. It supports the EU AI Act through harmonized standards and a horizontal AI conformity assessment and certification programme.",
